# Managed by chezmoi: dot_config/bat/config.
#
# The managed fish/PowerShell environments point BAT_CONFIG_PATH here so the
# same file is used on Linux, macOS and Windows (bat reads %APPDATA% by default
# on Windows, not the XDG directory).
#
# "Catppuccin Mocha" ships with bat 0.24+ and matches Windows Terminal,
# WezTerm, Ghostty, Zellij and the Starship prompt.
--theme="Catppuccin Mocha"
--style=numbers,changes,header
--italic-text=always
--paging=auto
--tabs=4
